    328					 ; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
    329					 ; Startup and lifetime. Only Main owns	the event loop and termination.
    330					 ; DOSSEG puts the stack last: shrink the PSP block through its	END,
    331					 ; not through the current SP. DOS can then allocate the released paragraphs.
    332					 ; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
